DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Michigan Cities (incl. Detroit): City of Detroit individual income 
 tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Annual return for the prior calendar year\, administered by Mic
 higan Treasury since 2015 | The 2025 City of Detroit individual income tax 
 return is due April 15\, 2026\, matching the Michigan state deadline since 
 the state took over Detroit city-tax administration in 2015 (an older\, pre
 -2015 April 30 due date no longer applies). | Authority: Direct fetch of mi
 chigan.gov/taxes/citytax/detroit this session | Source: https://www.michiga
 n.gov/taxes/citytax/detroit/individual | This date is computed from a recur
 rence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; confirm against t
 he cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
